menu "M5Stack Tough hardware"

choice TOUGH_PANEL
    prompt "LCD controller"
    default TOUGH_PANEL_ILI9342C
    help
      M5Stack has built the Core2 family with two display controllers that
      need different init sequences: the ILI9342C and, in later batches, the
      ILI9342E (see M5GFX, Panel_ILI9342E). Both are 320x240. Sending the C
      sequence to an E is not guaranteed to work. Until the firmware tells
      them apart on the bus, pick the one your board has; if the screen stays
      dark or the colours are wrong with one, try the other.

    config TOUGH_PANEL_ILI9342C
        bool "ILI9342C"

    config TOUGH_PANEL_ILI9342E
        bool "ILI9342E"

endchoice

endmenu
